// ⚠️ AND THE `You may` PREFIX IS THE ONLY DIFFERENCE FROM THE BARE ANCHORS, WHICH
// IS WHY THESE ARE FOUR SEPARATE WHOLE-STRING REGEXES RATHER THAN ONE OPTIONAL
